                  <span class="teaser-go" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                </a>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ================= CINEMA × CAREER（影評放映室） ================= -->
    <section class="dark grain cinema">
      <div class="cinema-strip" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="cinema-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="now-showing">● NOW SHOWING · CINEMA × CAREER</div>
            <h2>探索者的人生，<br />和一部好電影一樣 ——<br /><span class="amber">找到對的角色，比演完所有戲更重要。</span></h2>
            <p class="sub">我也是個影評人。轉職、選方向、找特質 —— 一部電影能說清楚的事，程式碼說不出來。<br />關於選擇，關於角色，關於什麼時候該慢一點。</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="final-scene">
              <span class="final-tag">FINAL SCENE</span>
              <div class="scene-line">“You need to believe that something extraordinary is possible.”</div>
              <div class="scene-sub">—— 寫給每個還在「會不會太晚」的你。</div>
            </div>
            <a class="film-pod" href={PODCAST_FILM_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
              <span class="film-pod-icon" aria-hidden="true">🎙</span>
              <span><b>聽《塵影》</b><small>說書 × 電影的 Podcast · 第一集：當代名導的電影大師課</small></span>
              <span class="film-pod-go">收聽 →</span>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="reviews-head">
          <div class="label review-label">SCREENING ROOM · 影評放映室</div>
          <a class="btn btn-line btn-sm" href="/reviews">進入影評放映室 →</a>
        </div>
        <div class="review-grid">
          {reviews.map((r, i) => (
            <a class="review" href={`/reviews/${r.id}`}>
              <div class="review-top"><span>{`ADMIT ONE · No. ${String(i + 1).padStart(3, '0')}`}</span><span>★ 影評</span></div>
              <h3>{r.data.title}<small>{r.data.en}</small></h3>
              <div class="review-dir">導演｜{r.data.director}</div>
              <blockquote>「{r.data.pull}」</blockquote>
              <p class="review-lead">{r.data.description}</p>
              <span class="review-more">讀完整影評 →</span>
            </a>
