      <div class="glow center-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="label center">FINAL SCENE · 下一場，換你</div>
        <h2 class="center">不用準備好才來。<br />帶著現在的卡關就好。</h2>

        <div class="final-pre">
          <div class="final-foryou">
            <div class="label">—— FOR YOU ——</div>
            <h3>如果你正在轉職的路上 ——<br />這幾件事，我想先告訴你。</h3>
            <div class="foryou-grid">
              {forYou.map(([t, d]) => (
                <div class="fy">
                  <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#F0B45E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12" /></svg>
                  <div><b>{t}</b><p>{d}</p></div>
                </div>
              ))}
